[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STD010
TITLE: PropEr state machine for concurrency, crash, recovery, and agreement
STATEMENT: >>>
The PropEr state machine shall generate sequences of clearance commands, concurrent submissions, a member crash, and a restart that replays the log. Every accepted sequence shall preserve the exclusive-volume invariant, and every crashed member that restarts shall match the surviving log prefix before it accepts a new command. A failing property shall fail the build. Acceptance is a PropEr run of this module that passes, and a deliberate invariant break that fails the property.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
These samples are conformance evidence. They are not a proof that the Erlang code refines the TLA+ spec.
<<<
DAL: A
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Low-Level
VERIFICATION: PropEr
ASSUMPTIONS: Raft is assumed to deliver one ordered log and is not re-proved.
